// Nimbus markdownlint ruleset.
//
// Notes on rule choices:
// - MD013 (line-length): disabled for now. The 120-col target is sound
//   but mass-applying it across the existing docs tree (~900 violations across 30 files,
//   many of them intentional single-line paragraphs in roadmap.md / architecture.md) is its
//   own multi-PR effort. The gate still catches the real quality issues below; line-length
//   tightening can land as a follow-up once the docs are reformatted.
// - MD024 (no-duplicate-heading): siblings-only — duplicate H2/H3 names are fine across
//   different parent sections (e.g. "Notes" under each phase).
// - MD033 (no-inline-html): disabled — README and design docs use raw <picture>, <details>,
//   <kbd>, etc. for GitHub-specific rendering features.
// - docs/README.md used to be excluded here. It is now the repository LANDING PAGE (the root
//   README.md was deleted as a duplicate, and GitHub falls back to docs/README.md to render the
//   repo home), so the most-read file in the tree is the last one that should skip the gate.
//   Un-excluding it surfaced 7 issues — 5 MD040 unlabelled fences and one MD001+MD026 tagline
//   heading — all fixed rather than suppressed; the whole tree is clean with it included.
// - MD034 (no-bare-urls): enabled — every URL must be a proper link so lychee can verify it.
// - MD036 (no-emphasis-as-heading): disabled — legitimate emphasis (e.g. "**Note:**") trips
//   this rule and there is no contextual signal that distinguishes real headings.
// - MD041 (first-line-heading): disabled — files like CHANGELOG.md and templates may open
//   with prose or front-matter blocks.
// - MD060 (table-column-style): disabled — the repo's canonical compact table form
//   `|---|---|` is valid markdown and switching every table to `| --- | --- |` adds noise
//   without quality gain.
{
  "config": {
    "default": true,
    "MD013": false,
    "MD024": { "siblings_only": true },
    "MD033": false,
    "MD034": true,
    "MD036": false,
    "MD041": false,
    "MD060": false
  },
  "globs": [
    "docs/**/*.md",
    "*.md",
    "!docs/perf/slo.md",
    "!.claude/worktrees/**",
    "!node_modules/**",
    "!packages/docs/dist/**",
    "!CHANGELOG.md"
  ]
}
